{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"一阶无穷小线段"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"一阶无穷小线段"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"综合微分几何","text":"综合微分几何"}},{"Plain":"中, <strong>一阶无穷小线段</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"直线(SDG)","text":"直线"}},{"Plain":" $R$ 上平方为零的元素的集合:\n$$\r\nD = \\{x\\in R \\mid x^2 = 0\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}